PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Defendant most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Dismiss the suit filed by the Plaintiff with exemplary costs;

b) Grant the Defendant's counter-claim, if any, for {counter_claim_details};

c) Allow the Defendant's set-off in the sum of Rs. {set_off_amount}/-, if pleaded;

d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Defendant shall ever pray.
